      "created_at": "2026-02-23T07:13:35.855Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, Everyone</p>\n<p>I am currently trying to add employees in the Payroll section. My requirement is that when I select the branch as <strong>Corporate</strong>, the system should automatically fetch and display all employees linked to the <strong>Corporate</strong> branch.</p>\n<p>However, even after assigning the branch “Corporate” to certain employees, their names are not appearing in the Payroll section. My objective is to add the relevant employees and proceed with payroll processing based on their attendance or any other applicable method.</p>\n<p>I am unable to understand where the issue lies. Kindly let me know if I am missing any configuration or doing something incorrectly. I have attached a screenshot for your reference.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/8/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804\" title=\"aa22\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804_2_690x304.png\" alt=\"aa22\" data-base62-sha1=\"h8toCFJmCd4U5n5xbM4WkkiDxpa\" width=\"690\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804_2_690x304.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804_2_1035x456.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/781a2f4feace7119f20ea87a78b32c270558c804_2_1380x608.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">aa22</span><span class=\"informations\">1837×812 49.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\">